00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:08.390 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  [Music]  [Music]  long ago humans and pokemon had not yet  learned to coexist  [Music]  this land  is the jesuit region  it will come to be known as the sinnoh  region  and at this time the ecology of its wild  pokemon remains unknown  therefore  many people still fear pokemon  and such people live together in  jubalife village  where this story begins  [Music]  your goal is to research the pokemon of  this region  [Music]  as a member of the galaxy expedition  team  an organization dedicated to studying  this land  you will strive to complete the first  pokedex in the region  research begins at a base camp from  which you'll embark on excursions  you can catch wild pokemon with  pokeballs  [Music]  be warned  not every pokemon is so easy to catch  in such an event  one option is to challenge them to a  battle  command your pokemon to weaken the  opponent and it should be easier to  catch  pokemon behaviors vary in the isui  region  they may live in groups  or they may flee upon sensing your  presence  the aggressive sort will attack without  hesitation  [Music]  some are much more powerful than you if  danger comes your way  run  it's quite the important research tip  back at your base camp you can let your  team of pokemon recover their health  professor lavinton a researcher on the  galaxy expedition team will provide  research support  report back to the professor with any  and all research and the information  will be entered into the pokedex  there are various research tasks of note  including number caught and times you've  seen it use moves  as you fulfill these tasks such entries  will populate  [Music]  the central hub for your research is  jubilife village  it's a great place to prepare for  excursions  visit the general store where you can  purchase items with in-game currency  or head to the craftworks to craft using  the materials you've gathered  [Music]  the pokemon you've caught can be left at  pastures  [Applause]  the clothier and hairdresser let you  customize your clothing and your  hairstyle as well  when you feel like it head to the  photography studio to take pictures with  your pokemon  juba life village is also home to the  headquarters of the galaxy expedition  team  [Music]  alongside commander comodo  and captain cylene  you will carry out pokemon research and  survey missions  in doing so  you will grow as a team member and  eventually explore new areas of the  region  certain pokemon with special powers will  allow you to ride them  [Music]  with the aid of your pokemon  your research will take you to greater  areas of the region  eventually  you will come to learn about noble  pokemon respected by the people of jesui  frenzied by a mysterious power  these pokemon will stand up against you  for just such an occasion special foams  have been created to calm them  [Music]  dodge powerful attacks and create  opportunities to challenge it to pokemon  battles  quell the noble pokemon through various  methods  vast lands  [Music]  and wild threats await you  [Music]  and what is the mythical pokemon arceus  [Music]  the story of humans and pokemon begins  right here in the jesui region  pokemon legends arceus  available january 28th on the nintendo  switch system digital pre-orders are  available now on nintendo eshop

